.* WRKOUTQD: an output queue's description, over two pages; F13
.* prompts CHGOUTQ.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VALCL BASETYPE='CHAR 20'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 30'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OUTQ CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OUTQLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=WTRACT CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=WTRNAME CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=HELD CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MAXPAGES CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MAXSTR CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=MAXEND CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=AUTOSTR CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DSPDTA CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=JOBSEP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=OPRCTL CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SEQ CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DTAQ CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=DTAQLIB CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=AUTCHK CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=RMTSYS CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=USRDFNOPT CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=USRDFNOBJ CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=USRDFNLIB CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=USRDFNTYP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=SPLFASP CLASS=VALCL.
:VAR NAME=TEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=WIDEST CLASS=VALCL.
:KEYL NAME=QDKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='RETURN 13'.F13=Change
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKOUTQD KEYL=QDKEYS HELP=WRKOUTQD ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SPACE.Work with Output Queue Description
:DATA DEPTH=2 COMPACT.
:DATAI VAR=OUTQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Queue
:DATAIX VAR=OUTQLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAIXT.Library
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.Status
:DATAI VAR=WTRACT USAGE=OUTPUT.Writer active
:DATAI VAR=WTRNAME USAGE=OUTPUT.Writer name(s) if active
:DATAI VAR=HELD USAGE=OUTPUT.Output queue held
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.Maximum spooled file size
:DATAI VAR=MAXPAGES USAGE=OUTPUT.Number of pages
:DATAI VAR=MAXSTR USAGE=OUTPUT.Starting time
:DATAI VAR=MAXEND USAGE=OUTPUT.Ending time
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=AUTOSTR USAGE=OUTPUT.Writers to autostart
:DATAI VAR=DSPDTA USAGE=OUTPUT.Display any file
:DATAI VAR=JOBSEP USAGE=OUTPUT.Job separators
:DATAI VAR=OPRCTL USAGE=OUTPUT.Operator controlled
:DATAI VAR=SEQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Order of files on queue
:DATAI VAR=DTAQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Data queue
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=DTAQLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=AUTCHK USAGE=OUTPUT.Authority to check
:DATAI VAR=RMTSYS USAGE=OUTPUT.Remote system
:DATAC.
:DATAC.
:DATAC.
:DATAI VAR=USRDFNOPT USAGE=OUTPUT.User defined option
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.User defined object
:DATAI VAR=USRDFNOBJ USAGE=OUTPUT.Object
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=USRDFNLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=USRDFNTYP USAGE=OUTPUT.Object type
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=SPLFASP USAGE=OUTPUT.Spooled file ASP
:DATAI VAR=TEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text description
.* Not shown: it sets the colon column.
:DATAI VAR=WIDEST USAGE=OUTPUT DISPLAY=NO.Names of the active printers
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKOUTQD.Work with Output Queue Description - Help
:P.How an output queue is set up: whether it is held, whether a writer
prints from it, the order of its files and who may see them. F13
prompts the change command for the queue.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
